# Negative control — each caller gets its own announcement. The state moves from
# module scope into the composable, so a page's `show()` lands in a copy the
# shell's bar never reads, and a `dismiss()` from anywhere else clears nothing.
#
# Intended RED:
#   packages/modules-foundation/src/announcements/__tests__/useAnnouncement.test.ts
#     "draws a page's announcement in the bar beside it, with no provider in the tree"
#     "takes the bar down when any caller dismisses"
#     "gives every caller the same visibility and the same announcement"
#     "carries the action the page gave it to whoever draws it"
#     "draws the latest announcement in place of the one before"
#     "keeps the announcement on the bar after the page that showed it goes away"

